is is ambiguous. Let me not report this yet. Focus on clearer bugs.\n\nNow let's save this group (night owl off, 7:00 AM, daily, today, estradiol 2mg, remind me). Save and check Plan.\n\nActually wait, \"Remind me\" is checked by default and \"Reminders may be delayed.\" Let me save."}
