cker showed a single \"Select Time\" dialog at 9:00.\n\nLet me test again: tap the weekly TIME row, pick 5:00 AM, OK. If row becomes \"7:00 AM → 5:00 AM\" or \"5:00 AM → 9:00 AM\" etc. That tells us the model.\n\nActually, wait. Maybe the first number is the \"start time\" (7:00) that was set BEFORE I changed to 6:00 because weekly's cached copy wasn't refreshed. Ugh.\n\nLet me do a cleaner test: tap weekly TIME row, pick 10:00 PM (22:00), OK. Then look."}
