n.\n\nActually the task's changed areas: \"group setup and scheduling\" generally. So any scheduling bug is in scope. Let me explore.\n\nTest A: In Daily, edit 9:00 → 10:15. Switch to Weekly (TIME?), then back to Daily. Check if 10:15 remains."}
